menu "WiFi Dap WiFi manager"

    config BIRDIEBOT_WIFI_CRED_MAX
        int "Maximum number of remembered WiFi credentials"
        range 1 8
        default 8
        help
            Number of WiFi networks remembered by the firmware
            (docs/wifi-credential-memory.md §1). The NVS schema and the JSON
            contract are frozen for values 1..8; values above 8 are not
            supported.

    config BIRDIEBOT_AP_PASS
        string "Default SoftAP password (8..63 bytes)"
        default "12345678"
        help
            SoftAP password used when no custom password has been stored with
            WIFI cmd 8 SET_AP_CRED (docs/wifi-credential-memory.md §6).
            README/UI must tell users to change it on first use.

endmenu
